WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.710
Dream...

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:04.740
The day the dream didn't end...

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.860
Always, at the same place...

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.400
All the time, you could only wait...

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.110
That was all you could do...

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.110
So...

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.240
I'm still waiting...

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.300
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

